# ── Data & artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Raw downloads and intermediate frames are reproducible from the pipeline and
# far too large for version control. Reports are small and are kept, because the
# product reads its charts and metrics from them.
ml/data/raw/
ml/data/interim/
ml/data/processed/
ml/models/*.joblib

